hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1297","On the authority of Abd al-Wahhab ibn al-Hakam, on the authority of Abd al-Majid ibn Abi Rawwad, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, on the authority of al-Muttalib ibn Hantab, on the authority of Anas ibn Malik, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The rewards of my nation were presented to me, even the dirt that a man takes out of the mosque. “The sins of my nation: I have never seen a sin greater than a chapter of the Qur’an or a verse that was given to a man and then he forgot.”"
